{
  "uid": "hacknc-discharge-story",
  "title": "Discharge story",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "tags": [
    "hacknc",
    "traces"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "",
  "description": "Traces for people: pick a run, see the hops, filter to the story spans.",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "trace",
        "label": "Trace ID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "hide": 0
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read a trace",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**One question in the hospital app = one trace.** Pick a run on the left; it opens below.\n\n| In the trace | Pillar | What it shows |\n|---|---|---|\n| `ui.action` | 🧑 who asked | the clinician, their role and token scopes |\n| `orchestrator plan`, `agent …`, `llm …` | 🧭 agents | who was asked to do what, and when the model was used |\n| `token_exchange A -> B` | 🔑 privilege | Keycloak trading a token for a narrower one (or refusing) |\n| `ehr-mcp <tool>`, `→ opa POST /v1/data/…` | 🛡 trust | the gateway asking OPA before touching any record |\n| `→ audit-service POST /events` | 📝 accountability | an entry in the hash-chained audit trail |\n\n**Too many spans?** In the trace view open *Span filters* and add the tag `story` = `true`: only the spans\nthe live map in the app shows remain highlighted. Health checks, FastAPI internals, MCP handshakes and\nOPA's duplicate server spans are dropped by the Collector before they reach Tempo."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Runs: one per question or action (click to open)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "tableType": "spans",
          "limit": 30,
          "query": "{ name = \"ui.action\" } | select(span.user.name, span.ui.action, span.question)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceIdHidden"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceService"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "traceName"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "spanID"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "name"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "custom.hidden",
                "value": true
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "user.name"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Who"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "ui.action"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Action"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "question"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "displayName",
                "value": "Asked"
              },
              {
                "id": "links",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "title": "Show this run below",
                    "url": "/d/hacknc-discharge-story/discharge-story?var-trace=${__data.fields.traceIdHidden}&${__url_time_range}"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [
          {
            "displayName": "Start time",
            "desc": true
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Refused or blocked (click the span to see it in context)",
      "gridPos": {
